    "Para ordenar fracciones, observamos cuál representa una parte más pequeña o más grande del todo.\n\n## De menor a mayor\nEmpezamos por la fracción más pequeña y terminamos en la más grande.\n\n**Ejemplo:** 1/4 < 1/2 < 3/4\n<div class=\"flex gap-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1\">\n      <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-500\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div>\n      <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"font-bold mt-1\">1/4</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">cuadrado</span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold self-center\"><</span>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <div class=\"relative w-12 h-12\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(#3b82f6 0% 50%, #f1f5f9 50% 100%); border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #475569;\">1/2</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">círculo</span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold self-center\"><</span>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"w-12 h-12\" style=\"border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <path d=\"M50 5 L95 40 L80 95 L20 95 L5 40 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L50 5 L95 40 Z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L95 40 L80 95 Z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L80 95 L20 95 Z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L20 95 L5 40 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L5 40 L50 5 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n    </svg>\n    <span class=\"font-bold mt-1\">3/4</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">pentágono</span>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "Para ordenar fracciones, observamos cuál representa una parte más pequeña o más grande del todo.\n\n## De mayor a menor\n---\nEmpezamos por la más grande y terminamos en la más pequeña.\n\n**Ejemplo:** 3/5 > 2/5 > 1/5\n<div class=\"flex gap-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <div class=\"relative w-12 h-12\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(#3b82f6 0% 60%, #f1f5f9 60% 100%); border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #475569;\">3/5</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">círculo</span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold self-center\">></span>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-1\">\n      <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-500\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-500\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-gray-300\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"font-bold mt-1\">2/5</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">cuadrado</span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold self-center\">></span>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"w-12 h-12\" style=\"border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <path d=\"M50 5 L95 40 L80 95 L20 95 L5 40 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L50 5 L95 40 Z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L95 40 L80 95 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L80 95 L20 95 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L20 95 L5 40 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n      <path d=\"M50 50 L5 40 L50 5 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n    </svg>\n    <span class=\"font-bold mt-1\">1/5</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1\">pentágono</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
